{"id":"ciertamente","lemma":"ciertamente","pos":"adv","rank":1572,"glosses":["certainly"],"ipa":"/ˌθjeɾtaˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Wikipedian-walker-ciertamente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom es ciertamente patoso.","en":"Tom certainly is clumsy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804248"},{"text":"Tom es, ciertamente, un anciano.","en":"Tom certainly is an old man.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/306289"},{"text":"Tom ciertamente no está feliz.","en":"Tom is definitely not happy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/306300"},{"text":"Ciertamente deseo que suceda eso.","en":"I certainly hope that'll happen.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/299245"},{"text":"Ciertamente, Tom no parece interesado.","en":"Tom really doesn't seem interested.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/306380"}]}